Next-Generation Stevia Glycosides
Reb M and Reb D offer opportunities for improved sweetness profiles with less bitterness. Cost-effective production and commercialization of these glycosides could help suppliers address demanding beverage and food applications.

Expansion into New Product Categories
Stevia offers opportunities beyond conventional tabletop sweeteners and beverages. Pharmaceutical syrups, lozenges, healthcare products, functional foods, and personal care formulations represent potential areas for application diversification.

